{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c5e970794a76bd4b674c43b626eed0547f1e9f806a1f984e6906c6ff3813abdc", "ja": "紬、ブログ更新してくれてありがとう。\n新しい衣装はどうだ？", "zh": "紬，谢谢你更新博客。新衣服感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ba1cfc07ecbbbf8baa7cc2cd2bd5b1888bd524cc4b9a995a7adaea14cd6ca243", "ja": "ブログを読んだのであれば、私がこのお衣装のことを\nどう思っているか、わかるかと思いますが……。", "zh": "既然您读过博客，应该就能明白我对这套服装的看法了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "05f0007366f21a4aecbc65a694cc67a06ce0b4ff813abe5b10e9da83524bf722", "ja": "ハッ！　まさか、貴方の記憶にも残らない\n粗末な内容だったとでも言いにきたのですか？", "zh": "哈！难道您是来告诉我，那内容粗劣到连您的记忆都留不下来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b8505190483a45eda4ac367ced56f3275645bb68136fba35d464d2b5456620b3", "ja": "違う違う！　ちゃんと読んだし、覚えてるよ！\nただ、直接感想が聞きたくてきたんだ。", "zh": "不是不是！我有好好读，也记得很清楚！只是想直接听听你的感想，所以才过来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fe728a1ff1ea49b1c98db1cb0d12815c7746bf6e69ae4d51de0d004d45163311", "ja": "そうですか……。まあ、それならいいのですが。\n直接聞きたいとは、いささか面倒な方なのですね。", "zh": "这样啊……嗯，那样的话就好。\n想直接听感想，您还真是有些麻烦呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1d7dd227a1ccb935ca0ca2b8660ae26a092b4aef1b0cae5fd0ceaf99b4b1bb27", "ja": "こほん……。それで、このお衣装についてでしたね。\nとても素敵だと思います。私にはもったいない程に。", "zh": "咳咳……。那么，刚才说的是这套服装吧。\n我觉得非常漂亮，漂亮到对我来说都有些受之有愧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8ac085ff058d0e09d208b75cccf417c2cb788938e744efc5501a56314978bca1", "ja": "ひらひらと揺れるスカートが可愛らしくて……\nまるで金魚のようですね。", "zh": "轻轻飘动的裙摆很可爱……\n简直就像金鱼一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1007_p", "source_sha256": "551ec969e5aca03d27dddc2f8ecc615ebcfbe68e68942c0672e020ee3ef0536b", "ja": "正解だ、紬！\n金魚をモチーフにした衣装なんだ。", "zh": "答对了，紬！  \n这是以金鱼为主题的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fd7a355da21986d11299578e723ea313f569398325106f4211bac9c3581fd322", "ja": "金魚を？\nなるほど、そうでしたか……。", "zh": "金鱼？\n原来是这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f2bb83fd731f0df936b776eb2a9d2fde6d0e9696cf10738c3205c4ba5fd3c65d", "ja": "ああ、曲の雰囲気にも合うと思って。\nそういえば、紬は金魚を飼ってたよな？", "zh": "嗯，我觉得也很符合歌曲的氛围。\n说起来，紬以前养过金鱼吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9693e3b7ba2c135ded5a2410163b527077076a48d180074ebb3a991436789f66", "ja": "はい。縁日の金魚すくいで迎えた子達なら、\n今も元気に泳いでいます。ですが……。", "zh": "是的。如果是庙会上捞来的那些金鱼，现在也还在精神十足地游着。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e456d4313a8b19edca6eec57b67c271e61399081d3855d95643f6237f7841299", "ja": "ん？　何かあったのか？", "zh": "嗯？发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e4cec7a6af982a573a6345e0143c2225ce17b61e43bb4a0e4455b849bb85179c", "ja": "その……突然、私が育てることになって、\nあの子達は戸惑ったのではないかと思ってしまって。", "zh": "那个……突然要由我来培养她们，我不禁觉得，她们当时一定很不知所措。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6d1b9813e6b3aba2a05a37c77baff71ad941159e9af2f44b136de04565fe92d8", "ja": "本当なら、別の未来があったのに、\n私が奪ってしまったのではないかと……。", "zh": "本来应该有另一种未来的，我却忍不住怀疑，是不是被我夺走了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "745ab457330d9caa1b67a10f0bbddebf37e86188c5d74164be7640343ebda137", "ja": "ふと、そんなことを考えてしまうのです。\n言葉が通じないので、確認しようもありませんが……。", "zh": "我不由得想到了这些。\n因为语言不通，也没办法确认……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1015_p", "source_sha256": "51dfa265422cf0f52944f5e694966666bf9f4d1bc537997de7595d725a0b9246", "ja": "そうだな……。でも、きっと幸せに思ってるはずだよ。\nいつもそばで、紬が見守ってるんだから。", "zh": "是啊……不过，它一定会觉得幸福的。\n因为一直有紬陪在身边守护着它。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b0d8116cbe6e225d9685c7f7915b86277be99a68332805098c0d78bb7940164b", "ja": "いつも、そばで……。\nそう、ですね……。", "zh": "一直，都在身边……\n是啊，说得对……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bdecf2bda131c79eb3f9616ff49c5222eceacbb1f48eaceade41f7a4565d07e8", "ja": "私も、思わぬきっかけで、アイドルという世界に\n飛び込んでしまいましたが……。", "zh": "我也是因为一个意想不到的契机，踏入了偶像这个世界……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bef5fb5dc28622c62b8f0ca2bec09aa4b84333c3a765acdb45f85cd2ccdb33d1", "ja": "素晴らしいお衣装をいただき、ステージにも\n立たせていただけて……それを、いつもそばで……。", "zh": "能得到这么棒的服装，还能站上舞台……而且一直在我身边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1019_p", "source_sha256": "5ed51fddcd6ca4c931b85a7746533b9dee02136a510efe049381e212294aca6d", "ja": "紬……？", "zh": "紬……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dabd1548b09883b601af48fba8ca076eb815f4cb746bafbda7e71427b1cf41ac", "ja": "で、ですから私は、し……しあ、わ……も、もう～！\n貴方という人はどれだけ無神経なのですかっ！", "zh": "所、所以我……幸、幸、幸……真是的～！\n你这个人到底有多不体贴啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0224_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5b1bdc35e9c8bbe146f55949c34033d15694169b1717f6a9c1a54af2c5401a45", "ja": "試着は終わりにします！\n着替えるので、部屋から出て行ってください！　早く！", "zh": "试穿到此为止！我要换衣服了，请您离开房间！快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
